      <title>Expanded Access to Generative AI Tools at FAS</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/blog-posts/expanded-access-to-generative-ai-tools-at-fas/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 21:18:02 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/blog-posts/expanded-access-to-generative-ai-tools-at-fas/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Hi All,&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I just want to bring your attention to an e-mail from May 6 about &amp;ldquo;Expanded Access to Generative AI Tools at FAS&amp;rdquo; that everyone should have received. Essentially there are three tiers of access to AI tools: 1) Free, 2) API key, and 3) License. I just want to clarify how IQSS is approaching access to each of these tiers. The form mentioned in the June 6 e-mail is only in regard to “License access”.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
